      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of the protective layer will correlate with improved structural and chemical stability during high-temperature exposure.",
